flowchart TD
    Track[Track plan] --> Premortem[Pre-mortem]
    Premortem --> Build[Build artifacts]
    Build --> RedTeam[Red-team review]
    RedTeam --> Findings[Findings]
    Findings --> Blockers{Release blockers?}
    Blockers -- yes --> Mitigate[Mitigate]
    Blockers -- no --> Accept[Accept residual risk]
    Mitigate --> RedTeam
    Accept --> Release[Release gate]
